{"job_id":"F-340a675291f3062c7cdc","family_id":"F-340a675291f3062c7cdc","title":"재외공관 수입금 등 직접사용에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":22,"target_id":"304bc571ad06a56ea267d72cee3a1bd32a0746c553eac7998b70b717be7ef4c8","source_hash":"6c9bd3ce3bb24b08d02a11ed22be9b127686b8881ecf6eee7a7a74731b0d5229","text":"关于海外外交使团直接使用收入等事项的法案"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":128,"target_id":"99581f83c928593add0004df0847815f48748d5002c5dafef1a4dbd3b1d2a46a","source_hash":"bb233eaa206c3b5c16014ed7edd56b96c3504ea8c6d5907b1ad6d625e6567a54","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是为了避免将资金存入国库所带来的行政复杂性，并促进外汇的有效利用，允许大韩民国相关外交使团直接使用运营费用的收入和未用余额。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":128,"end":291,"target_id":"fe274e3a09d07c547bbd6edab7541ddbf50f1fb8a7a5465beec9c8f292d331f8","source_hash":"218eed28930d13ec36811805b1eccde2e5df94291a3f14c9c143e0086c2316ba","text":"第二条（驻外使团直接使用收入等）尽管《国库管理法》第七条另有规定，外交部长可以根据总统令，责令韩国驻外使团团长直接使用其收入以及在相关使团预算范围内的剩余运营费用。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":291,"end":443,"target_id":"d001c47c4bf6d286056736301772b7cd777e50b6a746fe6a4328cfb5bb822161","source_hash":"33d27a14f2404a28e8007d972bec572e4b8595db06e2409a28793b08d36cac31","text":"第三条（直接使用收入的替代）外交部长向大韩民国驻外使团汇款时，应当从汇款金额中扣除使团团长根据第二条直接使用的收入以及使团日常开支的剩余部分，并将所得款项缴入国库。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":443,"end":487,"target_id":"074b56404d33edd76758290ab650a3db2ca4ab43cd5ee04efcc960a064f9ed46","source_hash":"c198c6c5487950495594e513ef1d71ef063704a1910ba065b5b2680d400c428f","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 1660，1964 年 9 月 22 日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":487,"end":519,"target_id":"6afc873364ddb453ceaec6003fe31fdcb27763a56141bb0e0190fb9406d1686f","source_hash":"34bc3ff52651b7e51cf40e61cc2da35ff63d50f0e037ed38e174f4586fd2279b","text":"补充条款（财政管理法）<第6836号法案，2002年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":519,"end":555,"target_id":"f15da1151e0df1cc9f34d42056dab13ec92e0aac3f644e289ee88098c743e144","source_hash":"b6886e000559b033e43012e93ae91d908787159d53f4ee71413499c69560e10b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2003年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":555,"end":570,"target_id":"b33caf7a5085a2522c114f298a2fbd65693d77876c018725584624b4188063dd","source_hash":"5b9afbdf2e8854c1395bfd4c406e8831273cb316d6a621d74a00d09486bb51ae","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":570,"end":670,"target_id":"7c12efc6cae7febdf0b9f94ea6b1d3a21a9023fbe596323a53bf4599adde0a58","source_hash":"9eda093efe879f498e07b93b933bc4422cea56e8dc32a9073d6e51ce67e70160","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至⑫ 已省略\n\n  ⑬ 《海外外交使团直接使用收入等的法令》修正如下。\n\n  第 1 条中的“福音传播资金余额”应改为“办公室运营费用余额”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":670,"end":783,"target_id":"f2113ca6e617b81250ce5599f0f461c449de4814beef7172701c0e324d468508","source_hash":"d87fe9896279a808722b36d2ae0e564dd343080ede7ff7c3c0c976988019d4fe","text":"  在第二条第一款中，“根据《预算会计法》第九条第一款的外交部长”应改为“根据《国库管理法》第七条的外交和贸易部长”；在同一条第二款中，“已用预付款余额”应改为“已用办公运营费用余额”。\n\n  ⑭ 至 <31> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":783,"end":791,"target_id":"2e8cecc2b88a17e5e040a6fd3560e06cb270dd6e17075eeebeb26d9d0c96724c","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":791,"end":821,"target_id":"6f9b6f792269b2cf0e7aaa947d8b417e7fbd4a043092df17ee9a1df96120af7a","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":821,"end":953,"target_id":"f1b7cbd6b4cded032f2c7574f49beae1a5608219526b5e566dd8159c6853d0ff","source_hash":"743784abe53932d9a3364d644aacdf2a60b7bc63b5878a85d9d7b10d7a351a80","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":953,"end":970,"target_id":"22a8be8c2b4e12eea2460e00088b8d1e60ae31d51862edf1d8850e2a442c6918","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":970,"end":1047,"target_id":"fcb7e833dd2c92a0f99231777da832736e83bddb831fe9e2d394d93c8c6afc1c","source_hash":"721413f9988ef3e80e7363d66e30514f961c7f6d99eb2383de3811100c8fdc90","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<165> 已删除\n\n  <166> 《海外外交使团直接使用收入等的法令》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1047,"end":1105,"target_id":"7115adc746f1114e32196c26fc000b6245a620469ae021fc454c2b4818a4a60b","source_hash":"793e80a862cf884c880db790d233bb3af043d2f7935834868308ae026ec86d33","text":"  第3条中的“外交部长”应改为“外交和贸易部长”。\n\n  <167> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1105,"end":1113,"target_id":"d811935deb1b8574a54f4d5f7b612e34c31d6d378a99ffa6851089adb56f6771","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1113,"end":1157,"target_id":"1d98c35d20904dd2041b2f7777b01136c5a43a6097317b113969967d1d765471","source_hash":"3aa6c5da5d753a42cb5d340817b5eb32abd2e57d9699c8a9b4772cffa829f1c7","text":"补充规定 <第10097号，2010年3月17日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1157,"end":1188,"target_id":"211514afc4f6b8c8585615bf8541ce7b0e466daa393a3c7b73df84511344647c","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第11690号法案，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1188,"end":1228,"target_id":"e3db9a04bc90fd1ee613ce31092aac47313feb7ff9ce9a684a64d036811b97c4","source_hash":"4308f2ced69d66c7c9c6968031f4ce6f1f458352a8aaaa88b04f09add335bc9e","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。 \n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1228,"end":1245,"target_id":"7f3f05e142e11f8d8b9eae2fea83b16922923b3574e3330795b478d1f764de51","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1245,"end":1325,"target_id":"3656c216f28bbb77b23152cbcd2b7e7e3771411785016e8cf9fdb5dd93823196","source_hash":"209567aecf569adc18cecb976a3ff25c657d4c9b8f3e06d920f3806f5298e0ec","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<100>款已省略\n\n  《海外外交使团直接使用收入等法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1325,"end":1390,"target_id":"d18a858d9a719a4b336e114d846bda4928b3171ad123456bf8b9c64d78d311db","source_hash":"5aa77368d8e99db66186135899f1cf7194c963c320e5437438e9490765646264","text":"  第 2 条和第 3 条中的“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  <102> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000003-136666-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1390,"end":1396,"target_id":"d584d00d322d9a189eefa1bd52af768def2d27044ee9c552e05ec0b4a0a2f7d4","source_hash":"ee13d383c2a08660c36c9d24a1572d3bce2aa066076202a729d3bb7dbe665312","text":"第7条省略"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":26,"target_id":"1d4c9fd035cd3e892d0e9d352482b51ccac4d26b1f49e71026be91bdcaf16e43","source_hash":"dffc4594291aac337c7066656bc0186867c5525bf149fe0fb945d30ee1ca51d1","text":"关于直接使用海外外交使团收入等的法律实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":146,"target_id":"d1e25304af9cedef0c07ee5e4840a4a6b48729b4bde92866233b3f405d3cfd0c","source_hash":"ed137116295439e147fe20d830d0cba5ba42581f21cc04472b5ecd9d6d85d860","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定大韩民国驻外使团团长根据《驻外使团直接使用收入等法》第二条的规定，在相关使团预算范围内直接使用其收入和剩余运营费用的必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":146,"end":444,"target_id":"254794887d4bd3cabd5ee2a27cc52ea1bbb0b1463b5a0ca475e977aca3ae0625","source_hash":"744a5fe66ac1acabecda240c3a4778f5425f65023f3ca3c4754f8c3e1c3e7dfe","text":"第二条（直接使用批准申请）\n① 大韩民国驻外使团（以下简称“使团”）团长如欲直接使用使团收入及剩余运营费用（以下简称“收入等”），须经外务大臣批准。<2013年3月23日修订>\n② 驻外使团团长为依据第1款获得批准，应当向外交部长提交一份申请，申请中应载明下列各款事项。<2013年3月23日修订>\n1. 待使用的收入等金额\n2. 收入或支出账户，用于记录收入等，以及用于使用这些账户的支出账户\n3. 东道国货币的近期汇率\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":444,"end":546,"target_id":"8b79a3f36d0e80238f36129b4cfa58d3013da72358647dbd49e922ff9c4b1b27","source_hash":"0307f97f7028ae5afd71f909e195e27c0a3e10367ef734b4553a69c2aac68070","text":"第三条（直接使用批准）外交部长收到依据第二条第二款提出的申请后，应当批准在分配给相关海外外交使团的办公经费范围内直接使用。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":546,"end":701,"target_id":"42f1981dc82405d89802d72e359f54a56f11cae4ec15eb738e7398d44418c03d","source_hash":"661556ab60f1f7086eef3aecd5171d198c4a6933616702355a285900ca262b48","text":"第四条（直接使用金额的替代支付）  外交部长根据第三条批准后，应当责令其管辖范围内的支出官员从拨付给相关驻外使领馆的款项中扣除相当于批准金额的款项，并将其上缴国库或存入相关支出账户。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":701,"end":746,"target_id":"a0ae466e2345528d7116406a18502e11d315681d029c668cf9ea1d4778569035","source_hash":"5bd8e005a571f12ce5d9dac4c417ba4a73be9ae1d31c7ff46291d815eb153c10","text":"补充条款 <第4259号，1969年11月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":746,"end":789,"target_id":"0e5d19e694fa26a66b4856bf0d793708e547b1956c725cd620057014b45b1173","source_hash":"0a879bcf7b396fc951de850c2451a22d9758802ce3c4c6191534aff21dd9f1f5","text":"增编（外交贸易部及其附属机构组织结构）<2008年12月31日第21241号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":789,"end":824,"target_id":"28c615ecf18a1c235c5e9f0d656cfd661cf3b9c4fd7651bae5f8150aee434e1b","source_hash":"6b2cce9c211671894b8f8a8a40d9864e5da5674e9685180cbbb27d1ed4186eea","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2009年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":824,"end":984,"target_id":"189ccd4417b24f9328c2cd62d49de2115362ba8a6e079e36c10affcf41e0917f","source_hash":"dd595d2d6cf683a577422afbac7a69a11d2529d8574b848c8f9da26d1efe7cd1","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑧ 省略\n\n  ⑨ 《关于海外外交使团直接使用收入等的法律实施细则》部分内容修订如下。\n\n  在第一条第一款中，除该条第二款的各分款以外的部分、第二条和第三条中，“外交部长”应改为“外交和贸易部长”。 \n\n  ⑩ 至 ⑬ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":984,"end":1028,"target_id":"cc0602c6943087e3262b8965d968e50181a71dd73b9004e84d530f620ec4de16","source_hash":"8bcaf5932df3ba4aef6969e0aba9056b50015c0583fa3c6fbe07e63914d373dd","text":"补充规定 <第23671号，2012年3月21日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1028,"end":1068,"target_id":"eb97c6712ffa6c89a1d8fc96418e6498c3918161d06c92f4da28ac3a103a1878","source_hash":"c065a4c939b9f2b1757f690983bd3df53ac92d65142803e4c9773d2adbc21e45","text":"增编（外交部及其附属机构组织结构）<2013年3月23日第24424号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1068,"end":1097,"target_id":"c7be8de2aabfcd0ff1945aca42629cd8932b813c5277b76727ca59d86bc72ab6","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1097,"end":1114,"target_id":"4304729d32ac4d5f4c77e43dbeea1ac7b4526c41c7d4f6df733f240a0dff9a9c","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-004644-135738-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1114,"end":1276,"target_id":"56c84b65e34a88ac12e2d4c788f9c8e90437e8ed3617a6bf69373763c0ea1636","source_hash":"74433f326af7a71b0b5c359ff92bcc1da942fc2f3ced961268ce5d1c98838cfa","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至⑨ 已省略\n\n  10. 对《关于直接使用海外外交使团收入等的法律》实施细则作如下部分修改。\n\n  在第二条第一款（除该条第二款的子款外）、第三条和第四条中，“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  ⑪ 至 <22> 已省略"}]}